{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04066","headline":"赠彭州权别驾 · 苏頲","name":"赠彭州权别驾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"双流脉脉锦城开，追饯年年往复廻。\n秪道歌谣迎半刺，徒闻礼数揖中台。\n黄莺急啭春风尽，斑马长嘶落景催。\n莫怆分飞岐路别，还当奏最掖垣来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}